StatStayTimeMu [SimTalk]
Returns the medium duration of the time during which Exporters/Workers stayed at a single importer who
is managed by the Broker designated by <Path>.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.StatStayTimeMu → time
Return Value
The return value has the data type time.
Example
print MyBroker.StatStayTimeMu
See also
Statistics report, Broker Statistics [described]
